: The pawn on b6 is my greatest asset. Pushing it to b7 creates an immediate, critical threat of promotion on the next move. Black will be forced to respond to this threat, likely with moves like Rb8 or possibly sacrificing material to stop the pawn. This forcing move puts maximum pressure on Black and could lead to either pawn promotion (winning material) or favorable tactical opportunities while Black scrambles to deal with the threat.\n\nAnswer: P: b6-b7"}
