t dangerous passed pawn to the 6th rank\n- Restricts the black king's mobility\n- The pawn will be difficult to stop and creates serious promotion threats\n- Forces Black into a defensive posture while I can continue developing with tempo\n\nThis is a forcing move that maximizes pressure on Black's vulnerable king position.\n\nAnswer: P: d5-d6"}
