 Restricts the black king's mobility\n- Forces Black into a defensive position\n- Brings me one step closer to queening\n- The pawn on d6 would be very difficult for Black to stop with limited pieces\n\nThis is a forcing move that maintains and increases my advantage, putting maximum pressure on my opponent.\n\nAnswer: P: d5-d6"}
